'''Greedent''' (Japanese: '''ヨクバリス''' ''Yokubarisu'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

