==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Rebel Clash|Greedent|152}} from the {{TCG|Rebel Clash}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Chilling Reign|Greedent|128}} from the {{TCG|Chilling Reign}} expansion.
*'''Enhanced Fang''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Alolan Raticate|82}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

